 disagreeing.","The referee is a Claude model and one of the readers is a Claude model too, so it may be favoured. Compare it with how the two referees agree with each other.","The sample (1000 comments) oversamples rare vibes and was partly chosen using the original ScaleDown batch labels, so it leans toward that classifier's view. About a quarter of it is label-independent (long, non-English, emoji, short, low-confidence).","The label rubric the original run used was tuned on ScaleDown's output. The showdown asks every per-comment reader a shared, shorter version of it, which no reader was tuned on.","LLM readers return one hard label, not probabilities, so calibration and confidence only compare the two decision models.","Cost per 1,000 is weighted to the channel's natural mix of comment types. Projections multiply it by the 48,038 de-duplicated comments. Cost counts successful responses only; retried or failed calls that were billed are not included.","Latency percentiles are on this stratified sample. Racing lanes shared the machine's network, so ranking uses the one-at-a-time probe.","Differences between two readers are judged with a paired test on the same comments. Overlapping error bars alone do not make a tie."]},"disagreements":[{"commentId":"c1gdjy55","text":"Rakai was a menace in this","stratum":"vibe:critical","answers":[{"readerId":"scaledown","vibe":"toxic","confidence":0.6290684632337309},{"readerId":"jev","vibe":"critical","confidence":0.57},{"readerId":"openai-decisions","vibe":"funny","confidence":0.48},{"readerId":"haiku","vibe":"critical"},{"readerId":"gemma","vibe":"supportive"},{"readerId":"luna","vibe":"funny"}],"referee":{"readerId":"referee-opus","vibe":"supportive"},"distinct":4,"handPicked":true,"cameraSafe":true,"readable":true},{"commentId":"cu4ge7f","text":"‏‪11:51‬‏ Roblox streamer","stratum":"vibe:spam","answers":[{"readerId":"scaledown","vibe":"spam","confidence":0.47380941127176585},{"readerId":"jev","vibe":"spam","confidence":0.8